Package: nexonsR
Title: Import and Analyse Nexons RNA Sequencing Results
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discover and lazily import gene and isoform read count tables
    produced by nexons for nanopore RNA sequencing analyses. Encapsulate
    result file paths and cached tables in an R6 object for downstream analysis.
